          <li>L. J. Guibas and R. Sedgewick, "A dichromatic framework for balanced trees," in <i>Proc. 19th Annual Symposium on Foundations of Computer Science</i>, 1978, pp. 8–21.</li>
          <li>Programiz, "Red-Black Tree" and "Insertion in a Red-Black Tree." <a href="https://www.programiz.com/dsa/red-black-tree">programiz.com/dsa/red-black-tree</a></li>
